# paste-buffer-sites.manifest — every FILE under monitor/ holding an executable
# `tmux paste-buffer`, recorded as data so test-paste-bracketed.sh's population
# floor is DERIVED and not a literal (your-org/nexus-code#1518, skeptic w237sk F6).
#
# One line per (file, count). A CHANGE here is a change to the population and
# must be acknowledged in a commit message: a new site is expected to ADD a row,
# and a removed site to drop one. Regenerating without saying which happened is
# what the derived floor exists to prevent.
monitor/paste-followup.sh	1
monitor/watcher/_respawn.sh	1
monitor/watcher/_unstick.sh	1
monitor/watcher/main.sh	1
